00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:19.000
So now you have an understanding of what
correlation is.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:25.000
Here's a few ways that correlation
analysis can be useful to traders and
portfolio managers in general.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.000
The first one is intermarket analysis.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:33.000
OK, that's monitoring market and economic
relationships to sort of understand the
current picture

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:39.000
and where we might be headed as well as
where opportunities potentially exist.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:45.000
That's a little bit like the sort of stuff
that we cover in the macro sections of
this video series.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.000
It's also useful for hedging.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:58.000
OK, calculating relationships between
assets can be sort of helpful to reduce or
hedge exposure in various ways.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:04.000
So it basically allows traders to target
